increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/16/clear-secure-inc-you-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"YOU 2022 Q1","e":"you","d":"2022-05-16","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ken Cornick","x":"As we mentioned, we're not going to raise price for existing members this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/16/clear-secure-inc-you-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"YOU 2022 Q2","e":"you","d":"2022-08-15","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Caryn Seidman-Becker","x":"All you have to do is turn on any TV station or, you know, online streaming to see how challenged the travel experience is and how people expect the predictable experience they have in other settings to happen in airports or in travel in general.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/15/clear-secure-inc-you-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"YOU 2022 Q2","e":"you","d":"2022-08-15","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ken Cornick","x":"But if you recall, we raised prices for new members only, not existing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/15/clear-secure-inc-you-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"YOU 2022 Q2","e":"you","d":"2022-08-15","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Paul Chang","x":"I know you did some price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/15/clear-secure-inc-you-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"YOU 2025 Q1","e":"you","d":"2025-05-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jen Hsu","x":"Q1 gross dollar retention was 87.1%, down 140 basis points sequentially, driven by comping large step function price increases from 2023 and 2024.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/clear-secure-you-q1-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"YOU 2025 Q1","e":"you","d":"2025-05-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jen Hsu","x":"These price increases had the greatest impact on gross dollar retention throughout 2024 and are now beginning to normalize.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/clear-secure-you-q1-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"YOU 2025 Q1","e":"you","d":"2025-05-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Caryn Seidman-Becker","x":"Our solution will allow users to verify their identity instantly and securely when signing high-trust agreements, streamlining processes in real estate, finance and legal industries.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/clear-secure-you-q1-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"YOU 2025 Q2","e":"you","d":"2025-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jennifer Hsu","x":"And we're obviously only a few weeks into the July 1 price increase, but retention thus far has been as we expected.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/clear-secure-you-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"YOU 2025 Q2","e":"you","d":"2025-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jennifer Hsu","x":"I would say, again, just to reiterate that, that metric is an output of retention and pricing, and pricing impacts that metric on an increasing basis as we annualize a price increase over the first 12 months.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/clear-secure-you-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"YOU 2025 Q2","e":"you","d":"2025-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Caryn Gail Seidman-Becker","x":"ClearOne will aid in the CMS initiative to help streamline the patient experience by eliminating the clipboard and enabling secure, seamless access to personal health information.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/clear-secure-you-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"YOU 2025 Q2","e":"you","d":"2025-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jennifer Hsu","x":"Our leadership team remains highly focused and committed to strategic prioritization, streamlining and driving operational efficiency.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/clear-secure-you-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"YOU 2025 Q3","e":"you","d":"2025-11-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jennifer Hsu","x":"This includes a regular cadence of price increases, closing the pricing gap with discounted members that we have acquired via our partnership channels and services such as CLEAR Concierge, which are add-on transactional opportunities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/clear-secure-you-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"YOU 2025 Q3","e":"you","d":"2025-11-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jennifer Hsu","x":"Q3 gross dollar retention was 86.9%, down 40 basis points sequentially and consistent with our expectations as the impact from the larger general airline and family price increases we took in 2023 continue to normalize.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/clear-secure-you-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"YOU 2025 Q3","e":"you","d":"2025-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Caryn Seidman-Becker","x":"Our mobile app enhancements are streamlining the enrollment experience and helping members navigate their day of travel with confidence and ease.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/clear-secure-you-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"YOU 2026 Q1","e":"you","d":"2026-05-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jennifer Hsu","x":"You've heard us say in the past that we anticipate taking a more measured approach to price increases, which would be consistent with our pricing actions in 2025.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/clear-you-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"YOU 2026 Q1","e":"you","d":"2026-05-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Wyatt Swanson","x":"How do you think about your ability to maybe support a broader travel member network, given like the eGate rollout, maybe the ability